  (3) Where the Administrator of the Korea Forest Service or the Mayor/Do Governor intends to designate or re-designate a quarry complex ex officio or upon application under Article 29(1) of the Act, they shall consult in advance with the heads of the relevant administrative agencies after reviewing whether the area meets the detailed designation criteria under paragraph (6) and the evaluation results of the quarry economic feasibility under Article 26(1) of the Act, and undergo deliberation by the Central Mountainous District Management Committee or the Regional Mountainous District Management Committee: <Amended on Aug. 5, 2005; Jul. 24, 2008; Dec. 24, 2008; Nov. 26, 2009; Aug. 22, 2012; Sept. 24, 2014>
