SECTION 3 Sale of Stones and Earth and Sand

Article 44 (Sale of earth and stones) (1) A person who wishes to purchase or receive a free donation of earth and stones in the mountainous district with a State forest area under Article 35(1) of the Act shall submit an application form to the Administrator of the Korea Forest Service, along with documents prescribed by Decree of Agriculture, Food and Rural Affairs. <Amended on Jul. 27, 2007; Feb. 29, 2008; Mar. 23, 2013>
