  (2) The Korea Quarrying Association shall have a chairperson, a vice chairperson, directors, and auditors as its executive officers. <Amended on Mar. 11, 2025>
  (3) Matters necessary for the business of the Korea Quarrying Association, the fixed number, term of office, and method of election of its executive officers, the qualifications of its members, and the establishment of branches shall be prescribed by its articles of incorporation. <Amended on Mar. 11, 2025>
  (4) The Korea Quarrying Association shall prepare the documents listed in each of the following subparagraphs and submit them to the Administrator of the Korea Forest Service by the end of February each year: <Amended on Mar. 11, 2025>
