(1) The Administrator of the Korea Forest Service shall formulate a plan for reduction or exemption under the amended provisions of Article 23(3) after deliberation by the Central Mountainous District Management Committee by December 31, 2019. In such cases, the Administrator of the Korea Forest Service shall notify the heads of the relevant central administrative agencies of a plan for reduction or exemption by no later than April 1, 2019.
(2) The cycle of formulating a plan for reduction or exemption under the amended provisions of Article 23(3) shall begin on January 1, 2020.
Article 5 (Transitional measures concerning transmission facilities)
(1) Where an application for permission for the temporary use of a mountainous district or permission for modifications thereof under Article 15-2 of the Act (hereafter referred to as "permission for the temporary use, etc. of a mountainous district" in this Article) is filed to install transmission facilities before this Decree enters into force, an application for permission for the conversion of a mountainous district or permission for modifications thereof under Article 14 of the Act (hereafter referred to as "permission for the conversion, etc. of a mountainous district" in this Article) shall be deemed filed on the same day.
(2) Any person who has obtained permission for the temporary use, etc. of a mountainous district to install transmission facilities before this Decree enters into force shall be deemed to have obtained permission for the conversion, etc. of a mountainous district.
(3) Any person who is deemed to have obtained permission, etc. for the conversion of mountainous districts under paragraph (2) shall submit a design plan for restoration of mountainous districts under Article 40 of the Act within the period classified as follows (where the previous period of permission for the temporary use, etc. of mountainous districts terminates earlier than the period classified as follows, referring to the previous period of permission for the temporary use, etc. of mountainous districts) and obtain approval therefor:
1. If the installation of transmission facilities has already been completed at the time of enforcement of this Decree: December 31, 2020;
2. If the installation of transmission facilities is in progress at the time of enforcement of this Decree: 2 years from the date of completion of the intended project.
