Notwithstanding the amended provisions of Appendixes 3, 3-2, 3-3, 4 and 4-2, the previous provisions shall apply where applications are filed for permission for the conversion of mountainous districts or permission for the modifications thereof, permission for the temporary use of mountainous districts or permission for the modifications thereof; or notifications are filed for the conversion of mountainous districts or notification of the modifications thereof, or notifications for the temporary use of mountainous districts or notifications of the modifications thereof are filed, before this Decree enters into force.

