The amended provisions of subparagraph 3s through v of Appendix 5 shall begin to apply to cases where an application for permission for the conversion or temporary use of mountainous districts is filed or where consultation is requested to take administrative dispositions under which permission for the conversion or temporary use of mountainous districts is deemed granted or excluded under other statutes after this Decree enters into force.
Article 6 (Transitional measures regarding exemption or reduction of substitute forest resource development charges)
Notwithstanding the amended provisions of Note 7 of Appendix 5, the previous provisions shall apply where permission for the temporary use of mountainous districts is obtained or an application for permission for the temporary use of mountainous districts is filed under Article 15-2 of the Act for the purpose of excavating buried cultural heritage before this Decree enters into force.

